{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13314","headline":"华清宫 · 皇甫冉","name":"华清宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骊岫接新丰，迢嶢驾翠空。\n凿山开秘殿，隐雾闭仙宫。\n绦阙犹栖凤，雕梁尚带虹。\n温泉曾浴日，华馆旧迎风。\n肃穆瞻云辇，沈深闭绮栊。\n东郊倚望处，瑞气霭蒙蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13314.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13314","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}